            {$Paulie}: Great! As a general rule of thumb, trash that goes into the yellow bins are paper, cardboard, cans, glass or plastic containers!
            {$Paulie}: I think S.P.A.R.C. wanted to see you once you grabbed the trash, so go have a chat!
            -> Neat!
